  "narration_lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "林大壮跌下山崖，本以为必死无疑，醒来后掌心却多了一道山神印。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_01.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 0.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.437,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:00fe74cb6a1c2a8a7f18bd677b73e8a144ff41aca535bcb1ac40fbfafdef57a6"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "从那一刻起，山里每一株草木的位置，他都能感知。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_02.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 4.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.371,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:811e921d3ea6fc374ce096783eaaa6ec0aae23e3e5a8fd7411a869bf3fb82ca5"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "他随手挖出的第一株，就是五十年份的野山参，这下妹妹的学费有了着落。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_03.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 8.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.267,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:6a6ff1b41f2bbf3909dfba6647cddd113fbd38eefe326b18b37e0e7ec626870f"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "可兄妹俩还没来得及高兴，狼群已经封死退路。为了护住妹妹，他第一次催动山神印。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_04.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 12.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.248,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "checksum": "sha256:1b8528fc1b6f3d1f5663f51df1876c4286921806b6c8a915a856dae955a8de2d"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "整群野狼竟低头退去，可家里的赌债，又盯上了妹妹的大学学费。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_05.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 17.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.053,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:3d01374e76a7f0b1078c43df6d08f0907bef83231c2421316ae096b3ef3d8ef2"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "为了兑现承诺，他只能带着人参进城变现，却刚进药店就被当成了穷鬼。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_06.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 22.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.395,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:9fcf55a2b76dd09eba3db8af417a00f7d947a19a67140bd061d7a71c8c8c4814"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "老板明明认出了极品，却欺负他不懂行情，只肯出二十万。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_07.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 28.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.584,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:82665de8f2d7617c2c6ce01795cef9c8bf8f7e9fdba92fd6659f2f711e1291f7"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "就在他准备离开时，真正识货的买家赶到，当场拿出五十万。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_08.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 31.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.797,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:4904c12c2fa9af2f905669e76c1423758bdd5a6bb0b8d0339f02d52ef75744f8"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "可钱刚到手，讨债的人已经抓住了妹妹。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_09.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 36.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.603,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "checksum": "sha256:fa64f36d41ec3022ea9becb7f288428b5abb0bb86d6609d1d564f2e95147156c"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "他们还以为，林大壮是那个任人欺负的穷小子。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_10.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 38.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.603,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "checksum": "sha256:a5c7e3ea6066143bb117351573d6ee43e40b22b086ba2dda5594e8769663f2ea"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "却不知道，如今站在面前的，是整座山选中的守山人。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_11.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 41.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.328,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "checksum": "sha256:8a4d88afd5b28b5b80d131af56295c7b24e84d24c453ba6eb4e2344249b9cc1c"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "山神印一亮，刚才还在叫嚣的人全部跪下。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_12.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 45.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.901,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:594d39473cf567ae3032b7448be92849c9c72e87bc8313856e487e0784f8c993"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "直到这一刻，他终于有能力护妹妹周全，而这，只是整座山送给他的第一份礼物。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/series_main_cut/candidate_v2/narration_13.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 48.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.565,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "checksum": "sha256:229a093354f61b56d4c8f7163bc0b30309f717a8efaff20a9d4addb86e36ce8e"
    }
  ],
